# REQUIRES: verilator
# The state scratch as a fixed allocation (foldsim-fold-static state-scratch-fixed): the same scratch RAM at every
# instance count. Each scratch class takes the largest proportional share (cap = n x V / all the classes' rows, V the
# same for every class) whose RAM primitives (URAM288 4,096 x 72, RAMB36 512 x 72) fit in the scratch, filled to the
# primitives' depth: the same at 32, 64 and 128 instances here (Driver/Inputs/fixedscratch: chains of leaves of
# Driver/Inputs/paged). Its resident RAMs are that deep, under-filled when fewer instances are resident.
# - A state-in-ram-pp class keeps the first r of each B instances resident and streams the others from HBM, at least
#   one in 16, so that its landing window and HBM path exist at every count. The stream bit and resident index are
#   digits of the instance (decoded tables). Without a storage rule its rows are in URAM288 at every count.
# - A paged class (its storage rule's on-chip kind included) keeps its pages on chip, page RAMs as deep as its share,
#   while the share holds all its instances; else its pages stream from HBM (pages=hbm).
# Against the target from zero state (Inputs/tb_pages.sv with a controller model per virtual memory, or
# Inputs/tb_late.sv when nothing is virtual), at response latencies of 1-60 host cycles, stalls, full controllers
# and bubbles.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/fixedscratch
# A large scratch: 30 of 32 resident, a share of 128 instances (two RAMB36 deep).
# RUN: env FOLDSIM_PP_ROWS=balanced foldsim --srcs top32.f --top Top --out %t/a32 --static --state-in-ram Leaf::8 --state-in-ram-pp --storage Leaf:sir=block --state-scratch-bits 100000 --state-scratch-fixed Leaf > %t/a32.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=A32 < %t/a32.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=A32SV < %t/a32/foldsim_sim.sv
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/a32 -Mdir %t/a32/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv leaf.sv top32.sv %t/a32/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/a32/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/a32/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/a32/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=1 +hi=60 +stall=20 +full=20 | FileCheck %s
# A small scratch: a share of 64 instances (one RAMB36 deep) at 64 and at 128 instances; at 128 half of them stream.
# RUN: env FOLDSIM_PP_ROWS=balanced foldsim --srcs top64.f --top Top --out %t/s64 --static --state-in-ram Leaf::8 --state-in-ram-pp --storage Leaf:sir=block --state-scratch-bits 40000 --state-scratch-fixed Leaf > %t/s64.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=S64 < %t/s64.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SSV < %t/s64/foldsim_sim.sv
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/s64 -Mdir %t/s64/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv leaf.sv top64.sv %t/s64/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/s64/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/s64/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/s64/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+5 +lo=5 +hi=40 +stall=20 +full=10 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: env FOLDSIM_PP_ROWS=balanced foldsim --srcs top128.f --top Top --out %t/s128 --static --state-in-ram Leaf::8 --state-in-ram-pp --storage Leaf:sir=block --state-scratch-bits 40000 --state-scratch-fixed Leaf > %t/s128.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=S128 < %t/s128.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SSV < %t/s128/foldsim_sim.sv
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/s128 -Mdir %t/s128/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv leaf.sv top128.sv %t/s128/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/s128/build.log 2>&1
