# A32: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: a share of 128 instances (73728 bits); 30 of 32 resident (15 of each 16), 2 stream from HBM
# A32: state-stream: Leaf: P 8, 2 of 32 instances streamed
# A32SV: {{pp(_res)?}}_1024x72 pp_res0_ext (
# S64: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: a share of 64 instances (36864 bits); 60 of 64 resident (15 of each 16), 4 stream from HBM
# S128: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: a share of 64 instances (36864 bits); 64 of 128 resident (8 of each 16), 64 stream from HBM
# SSV: {{pp(_res)?}}_512x72 pp_res0_ext (
# Z64: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: a share of 0 instances (0 bits); 0 of 64 resident (0 of each 16), 64 stream from HBM
# U64: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: a share of 512 instances (294912 bits); 60 of 64 resident (15 of each 16), 4 stream from HBM
# U64SV: {{pp(_res)?}}_4096x72 pp_res0_ext (
# P32: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: pages resident, a share of 2048 instances (589824 bits) for 32
# P32: pages Leaf: p 2, {{.*}}; page RAMs 4096 rows x 168 bits in 1 columns
# P64: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: pages resident, a share of 2048 instances (589824 bits) for 64
# P64: pages Leaf: p 2, {{.*}}; page RAMs 4096 rows x 168 bits in 1 columns
# Q32: state-scratch: fixed: Leaf: 9216 bits of pages stream from HBM (its share of 0 instances does not hold its 32; the share stays unused)
# Q32: pages Leaf: p 2, {{.*}}; off chip: 1 virtual memories
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
# CHECK-NOT: PROTOCOL
